{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T07:42:21+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-11-12T07:42:21+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Visa Inc.","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Credit Services","country":"United States","city":"San Francisco","website":"https://corporate.visa.com","employees":34800,"summary":"Visa Inc. operates as a payments technology company in the United States and internationally. It operates VisaNet, a transaction processing network that enables authorization, clearing, and settlement of payment transactions. The company also offers credit, debit, and prepaid card products; tap to pay, tokenization, and click to pay services; Visa Direct, a platform which facilitates money movement, enabling clients to collect, hold, convert, and send funds across its network; and issuing solutions, such as airport lounge access, dining reservations, shopping experiences, event tickets, and seller offers. In addition, it provides acceptance solutions, an omnichannel payment integration with e-commerce platforms; risk detection and prevention solutions; and advisory and other services comprising consulting practice, proprietary analytics models, data scientists and economists, marketing services, and managed services. The company provides its services under the Visa, Visa Electron, V PAY, Interlink, and PLUS brands. It serves consumers, sellers, financial institutions, and government entities. Visa Inc. was founded in 1958 and is headquartered in San Francisco, California.","exchange":"NYSE","currency":"USD","financial_currency":"USD","summary_fr":"Visa Inc. opère en tant que société de technologie de paiement aux États-Unis et à l'étranger. Il exploite VisaNet, un réseau de traitement des transactions qui permet l'autorisation, la compensation et le règlement des transactions de paiement. La société propose également des produits de cartes de crédit, de débit et prépayées; tap to pay, tokenization, and click to pay services; Visa Direct, une plate-forme qui facilite le mouvement de l'argent, permettant aux clients de collecter, détenir, convertir et envoyer des fonds à travers son réseau; et des solutions d'émission, telles que l'accès aux salons d'aéroport, les réservations de restaurants, les expériences de magasinage, les billets d'événements et les offres des vendeurs."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":793991184384,"shares_outstanding":1724473215,"trailing_pe":34.541397,"forward_pe":24.827293,"price_to_book":22.202223,"ev_to_ebitda":24.773,"ev_to_revenue":17.184,"dividend_yield":0.0073,"payout_ratio":0.2175,"beta_yahoo":0.786},"targets":{"current_price":425.55,"mean":449.06433,"median":455.0,"high":500.0,"low":330.0,"n_analysts":37,"reco_mean":1.5,"reco_key":"strong_buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2027-01-26"],"eps_avg":3.62965,"eps_low":3.58,"eps_high":3.75,"revenue_avg":12204669400,"ex_dividend":"2026-11-10","dividend_date":"2026-12-01"},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.00086000003,"institutions_pct":0.89322,"institutions_float_pct":0.89399004,"institutions_n":6037,"institutions":[{"name":"Blackrock Inc.","pct":0.0798,"shares":137669061,"value":58585067228,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0109},{"name":"Vanguard Capital Management LLC","pct":0.0616,"shares":106150500,"value":45172343979,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":-0.008},{"name":"State Street Corporation","pct":0.0481,"shares":82872209,"value":35266267528,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0069},{"name":"FMR, LLC","pct":0.0278,"shares":47947240,"value":20403947396,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.1169},{"name":"Geode Capital Management, LLC","pct":0.027,"shares":46646920,"value":19850596236,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.0301},{"name":"Morgan Stanley","pct":0.026700001,"shares":45960354,"value":19558428083,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":-0.0004},{"name":"Vanguard Portfolio Management LLC","pct":0.0214,"shares":36844619,"value":15679227165,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":-0.0202},{"name":"Price (